L1: Beetroot juice — a suitable post-marathon metabolic recovery supplement?
L2: Journal of the International Society of Sports Nutrition (2021)
L3: Zinandré Stander, Laneke Luies, Mari van Reenen, Glyn Howatson, Karen M. Keane, Tom Clifford, Emma J. Stevenson, Du Toit Loots
L4: 1 grid.25881.36 0000 0000 9769 2525 Human Metabolomics,  North-West University,  Potchefstroom, 2531 South Africa
L5: 2 grid.25881.36 0000 0000 9769 2525 North-West University,  Potchefstroom Campus, Private Bag X6001, Box 269, Potchefstroom, 2520 South Africa
L6: 3 grid.42629.3b 0000000121965555 Faculty of Health and Life Sciences, Department of Sport, Exercise and Rehabilitation,  Northumbria University,  Newcastle upon Tyne, NE1 8ST UK
L7: 4 grid.25881.36 0000 0000 9769 2525 Water Research Group, School of Environmental Sciences and Development,  North-West University,  Potchefstroom, 2531 South Africa
